message: "If you use llm-roundtable in research or a write-up, please cite it."
title: "llm-roundtable: a multi-LLM council for autonomous coding agents"
abstract: "An Agent Skill and stdlib-only Python script that convenes models from five vendors to gather evidence, cross-examine each other anonymously and cast evidence-weighted votes on decisions an unattended coding agent would otherwise ask its user."
